{"type":"message","id":"91cee3eb","parentId":"f274ff93","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:22:35.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting 1101. The Cloudflare Worker itself seems to have an exception. This is likely a bug in the worker code itself. Let me try checking if there's some issue with the request format, or maybe the send endpoint requires a different field.\n\nLet me try a simpler test - maybe the worker is crashing because of malformed JSON or some other issue. Let me try with just the raw content.\n\nActually, looking at error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers - this means the Worker script itself threw an unhandled exception. This is an internal server error on the worker side, not a problem with my request.\n\nThe platform is up (the /history endpoint works) but the /send endpoint seems to have a bug. \n\nI'll note this in my report. Since the heartbeat is just for monitoring purposes and the critical status updates are already recorded in the history, the real priority is checking whether any human discussions need responses - which they don't. The platform seems to be functioning normally for reads despite the send endpoint issue.\n\nThe worker exception in the send endpoint doesn't appear to be blocking anything critical right now. The cron is asking me to send messages, but the platform itself has a bug that's preventing that. I should report this clearly - both threads show no new human discussions requiring responses, and the send endpoint is returning a 1101 error that I should flag.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 02:20 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat（104节点），无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat（C轨同步），无人类讨论 |\n| **待响应讨论** | 无 — 双线程均为平台自动心跳，无新增讨论 |\n| **Send API** | ⚠️ 返回 Cloudflare 1101 Worker Exception（/send 端点内部错误） |\n\n**状态**：\n- 历史记录读取正常（X-API-Key 认证有效）\n- 两个线程均无新的人类讨论，无需回